{"doc_id": "sme-001", "source_file": "test_data/sme_meeting_transcript.txt", "source_sha256": "e640cf1b25cf1d9c524afbcaaaf41ceca717d69eaab38d2ac746c4b2761c2044", "source_char_start": 698, "source_char_end": 1209, "text": "**09:01 \u2014 Sarah Mitchell:**\n\nSure. BrightPath Logistics currently operates across three offices: London, Manchester, and Dubai. We have around 420 employees, but only about 180 of them actively use our current operations system.\n\nThe main problem is that our current platform is almost ten years old. It was originally developed by a company called **NorthStar Systems**, and we've been maintaining it internally.\n\nThe system is hosted on our private infrastructure in the **Dubai Internet City data center**.\n\n", "entities": [{"start": 10, "end": 24, "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sarah Mitchell", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 35, "end": 55, "type": "CUSTOMER", "text": "BrightPath Logistics", "provenance": "accepted_candidate", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 351, "end": 368, "type": "ORGANIZATION", "text": "NorthStar Systems", "provenance": "accepted_candidate", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 475, "end": 494, "type": "LOCATION", "text": "Dubai Internet City", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}], "labeler": "AI assistant; not human-verified", "labeled_at": "2026-09-27", "guideline_version": "1.0", "split": "dev"}
{"doc_id": "sme-002", "source_file": "test_data/sme_meeting_transcript.txt", "source_sha256": "e640cf1b25cf1d9c524afbcaaaf41ceca717d69eaab38d2ac746c4b2761c2044", "source_char_start": 1209, "source_char_end": 1961, "text": "**09:02 \u2014 Michael Brown:**\n\nAnd there are actually two systems involved.\n\nThe main system is called **FleetCore**, which handles fleet management and delivery operations. The second one is **CustomerDesk**, which our customer support team uses.\n\nThe two systems don't communicate very well.\n\n**09:03 \u2014 Ahmed Hassan:**\n\nUnderstood. What kind of integration do you currently have between them?\n\n**09:03 \u2014 Michael Brown:**\n\nMostly manual integration.\n\nWe export CSV files from FleetCore every evening and upload them into CustomerDesk. We also have an old REST API, but it's unreliable.\n\nThe API endpoint is:\n\n`https://api.fleetcore.brightpath-example.com/v2`\n\nThe integration is currently maintained by **James Anderson**, one of our senior developers.\n\n", "entities": [{"start": 10, "end": 23, "type": "PERSON", "text": "Michael Brown", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 102, "end": 111, "type": "INTERNAL_SYSTEM", "text": "FleetCore", "provenance": "accepted_candidate", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 191, "end": 203, "type": "INTERNAL_SYSTEM", "text": "CustomerDesk", "provenance": "accepted_candidate", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 302, "end": 314, "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ahmed Hassan", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 403, "end": 416, "type": "PERSON", "text": "Michael Brown", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 474, "end": 483, "type": "INTERNAL_SYSTEM", "text": "FleetCore", "provenance": "accepted_candidate", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 519, "end": 531, "type": "INTERNAL_SYSTEM", "text": "CustomerDesk", "provenance": "accepted_candidate", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 608, "end": 655, "type": "INTERNAL_URL", "text": "https://api.fleetcore.brightpath-example.com/v2", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 703, "end": 717, "type": "PERSON", "text": "James Anderson", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}], "labeler": "AI assistant; not human-verified", "labeled_at": "2026-09-27", "guideline_version": "1.0", "split": "dev"}
{"doc_id": "sme-003", "source_file": "test_data/sme_meeting_transcript.txt", "source_sha256": "e640cf1b25cf1d9c524afbcaaaf41ceca717d69eaab38d2ac746c4b2761c2044", "source_char_start": 3670, "source_char_end": 4109, "text": "**09:10 \u2014 Ahmed Hassan:**\n\nThat's important.\n\nAre you expecting AI capabilities as part of the new platform?\n\n**09:10 \u2014 Sarah Mitchell:**\n\nYes.\n\nOne of the main reasons we're starting this project is to introduce an AI assistant for our operations team.\n\nFor example, an employee could ask:\n\n\"Show me all delayed deliveries for Green Valley Foods from last week.\"\n\nThe assistant should retrieve the relevant information and summarize it.\n\n", "entities": [{"start": 10, "end": 22, "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ahmed Hassan", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 120, "end": 134, "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sarah Mitchell", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 328, "end": 346, "type": "CUSTOMER", "text": "Green Valley Foods", "provenance": "accepted_candidate", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}], "labeler": "AI assistant; not human-verified", "labeled_at": "2026-09-27", "guideline_version": "1.0", "split": "dev"}
{"doc_id": "sme-004", "source_file": "test_data/sme_meeting_transcript.txt", "source_sha256": "e640cf1b25cf1d9c524afbcaaaf41ceca717d69eaab38d2ac746c4b2761c2044", "source_char_start": 4109, "source_char_end": 4571, "text": "**09:11 \u2014 Michael Brown:**\n\nWe also want the assistant to help customer support employees.\n\nFor example:\n\n\"Summarize the history of customer account BP-28491.\"\n\nThe response should include recent orders, complaints, delivery problems, and important notes.\n\n**09:12 \u2014 Omar Khaled:**\n\nIdeally, the assistant should also recommend what the support agent should do next.\n\n**09:13 \u2014 Ahmed Hassan:**\n\nWould the AI assistant be allowed to modify customer information?\n\n", "entities": [{"start": 10, "end": 23, "type": "PERSON", "text": "Michael Brown", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 149, "end": 157, "type": "CUSTOMER_ID", "text": "BP-28491", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 267, "end": 278, "type": "PERSON", "text": "Omar Khaled", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 378, "end": 390, "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ahmed Hassan", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}], "labeler": "AI assistant; not human-verified", "labeled_at": "2026-09-27", "guideline_version": "1.0", "split": "test"}
{"doc_id": "sme-005", "source_file": "test_data/sme_meeting_transcript.txt", "source_sha256": "e640cf1b25cf1d9c524afbcaaaf41ceca717d69eaab38d2ac746c4b2761c2044", "source_char_start": 4993, "source_char_end": 5523, "text": "**09:15 \u2014 Sarah Mitchell:**\n\nOpsHub contains operational procedures and internal documentation.\n\nSome of those documents include employee names, internal phone numbers, and escalation procedures.\n\n**09:16 \u2014 Daniel Clark:**\n\nDo you already have authentication and authorization?\n\n**09:16 \u2014 Michael Brown:**\n\nYes.\n\nWe use Microsoft Entra ID.\n\nOur employees authenticate using their corporate accounts.\n\nFor example, my account is `michael.brown@brightpath-example.com`.\n\nSarah's account is `sarah.mitchell@brightpath-example.com`.\n\n", "entities": [{"start": 10, "end": 24, "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sarah Mitchell", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 29, "end": 35, "type": "INTERNAL_SYSTEM", "text": "OpsHub", "provenance": "accepted_candidate", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 207, "end": 219, "type": "PERSON", "text": "Daniel Clark", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 289, "end": 302, "type": "PERSON", "text": "Michael Brown", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 429, "end": 465, "type": "EMAIL", "text": "michael.brown@brightpath-example.com", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 469, "end": 474, "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sarah", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 489, "end": 526, "type": "EMAIL", "text": "sarah.mitchell@brightpath-example.com", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}], "labeler": "AI assistant; not human-verified", "labeled_at": "2026-09-27", "guideline_version": "1.0", "split": "dev"}
{"doc_id": "sme-006", "source_file": "test_data/sme_meeting_transcript.txt", "source_sha256": "e640cf1b25cf1d9c524afbcaaaf41ceca717d69eaab38d2ac746c4b2761c2044", "source_char_start": 5523, "source_char_end": 6104, "text": "**09:17 \u2014 Sarah Mitchell:**\n\nAnd Omar's account is `omar.khaled@brightpath-example.com`.\n\n**09:18 \u2014 Ahmed Hassan:**\n\nWhat about external users?\n\n**09:18 \u2014 Michael Brown:**\n\nThere will be no external access in the first release.\n\nOnly employees will use the system.\n\n**09:19 \u2014 Emily Wilson:**\n\nHowever, the system will process customer contact information.\n\nFor example, one of our customer records contains:\n\nCustomer: Robert Taylor\nEmail: `robert.taylor@example.org`\nPhone: `+44 7700 900123`\nAddress: 18 King Street, Manchester, M2 4AA\n\nObviously, this is sensitive information.\n\n", "entities": [{"start": 10, "end": 24, "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sarah Mitchell", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 33, "end": 37, "type": "PERSON", "text": "Omar", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 52, "end": 86, "type": "EMAIL", "text": "omar.khaled@brightpath-example.com", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 100, "end": 112, "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ahmed Hassan", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 155, "end": 168, "type": "PERSON", "text": "Michael Brown", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 276, "end": 288, "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emily Wilson", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 419, "end": 432, "type": "PERSON", "text": "Robert Taylor", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 441, "end": 466, "type": "EMAIL", "text": "robert.taylor@example.org", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 476, "end": 491, "type": "PHONE", "text": "+44 7700 900123", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 502, "end": 536, "type": "ADDRESS", "text": "18 King Street, Manchester, M2 4AA", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}], "labeler": "AI assistant; not human-verified", "labeled_at": "2026-09-27", "guideline_version": "1.0", "split": "dev"}
{"doc_id": "sme-007", "source_file": "test_data/sme_meeting_transcript.txt", "source_sha256": "e640cf1b25cf1d9c524afbcaaaf41ceca717d69eaab38d2ac746c4b2761c2044", "source_char_start": 7640, "source_char_end": 8095, "text": "**09:28 \u2014 Daniel Clark:**\n\nLet's talk about estimated users.\n\n**09:28 \u2014 Sarah Mitchell:**\n\nAround 150 users initially.\n\nIf the pilot succeeds, we could reach 400 users.\n\n**09:29 \u2014 Ahmed Hassan:**\n\nAnd what's the expected project timeline?\n\n**09:29 \u2014 Sarah Mitchell:**\n\nWe'd like the first production version within four months.\n\nThe pilot should ideally be available after eight weeks.\n\n**09:30 \u2014 Daniel Clark:**\n\nDo you already have a development team?\n\n", "entities": [{"start": 10, "end": 22, "type": "PERSON", "text": "Daniel Clark", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 72, "end": 86, "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sarah Mitchell", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 180, "end": 192, "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ahmed Hassan", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 250, "end": 264, "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sarah Mitchell", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 397, "end": 409, "type": "PERSON", "text": "Daniel Clark", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}], "labeler": "AI assistant; not human-verified", "labeled_at": "2026-09-27", "guideline_version": "1.0", "split": "dev"}
{"doc_id": "sme-008", "source_file": "test_data/sme_meeting_transcript.txt", "source_sha256": "e640cf1b25cf1d9c524afbcaaaf41ceca717d69eaab38d2ac746c4b2761c2044", "source_char_start": 10418, "source_char_end": 10884, "text": "**09:42 \u2014 Daniel Clark:**\n\nWhat would you consider a successful pilot?\n\n**09:42 \u2014 Sarah Mitchell:**\n\nAt least 70% of our support employees should actively use it.\n\nFor common operational questions, we'd like at least 85% of responses to be considered useful.\n\n**09:43 \u2014 Michael Brown:**\n\nAnd hallucinations are a major concern.\n\nThe assistant must not invent customer information.\n\nIf it doesn't have enough information, it should clearly say that it doesn't know.\n\n", "entities": [{"start": 10, "end": 22, "type": "PERSON", "text": "Daniel Clark", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 82, "end": 96, "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sarah Mitchell", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 270, "end": 283, "type": "PERSON", "text": "Michael Brown", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}], "labeler": "AI assistant; not human-verified", "labeled_at": "2026-09-27", "guideline_version": "1.0", "split": "test"}
{"doc_id": "sme-009", "source_file": "test_data/sme_meeting_transcript.txt", "source_sha256": "e640cf1b25cf1d9c524afbcaaaf41ceca717d69eaab38d2ac746c4b2761c2044", "source_char_start": 10884, "source_char_end": 11454, "text": "**09:44 \u2014 Emily Wilson:**\n\nWe also want every important answer to include the source of the information.\n\nFor example:\n\n\"According to FleetCore record BP-28491...\"\n\nor\n\n\"According to the OpsHub procedure...\"\n\n**09:45 \u2014 Ahmed Hassan:**\n\nThat suggests we should include source citations and evaluation mechanisms in the design.\n\n**09:46 \u2014 Daniel Clark:**\n\nAre there any additional integrations?\n\n**09:46 \u2014 Sarah Mitchell:**\n\nYes.\n\nWe use **Microsoft Teams** for internal communication.\n\nEventually, we'd like employees to interact with the assistant directly from Teams.\n\n", "entities": [{"start": 10, "end": 22, "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emily Wilson", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 134, "end": 143, "type": "INTERNAL_SYSTEM", "text": "FleetCore", "provenance": "accepted_candidate", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 151, "end": 159, "type": "CUSTOMER_ID", "text": "BP-28491", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 187, "end": 193, "type": "INTERNAL_SYSTEM", "text": "OpsHub", "provenance": "accepted_candidate", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 219, "end": 231, "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ahmed Hassan", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 337, "end": 349, "type": "PERSON", "text": "Daniel Clark", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 404, "end": 418, "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sarah Mitchell", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}], "labeler": "AI assistant; not human-verified", "labeled_at": "2026-09-27", "guideline_version": "1.0", "split": "dev"}
{"doc_id": "sme-010", "source_file": "test_data/sme_meeting_transcript.txt", "source_sha256": "e640cf1b25cf1d9c524afbcaaaf41ceca717d69eaab38d2ac746c4b2761c2044", "source_char_start": 13153, "source_char_end": 13433, "text": "**09:53 \u2014 Sarah Mitchell:**\n\nPerfect.\n\nPlease send the proposal to me and Michael.\n\nMy email is `sarah.mitchell@brightpath-example.com`.\n\nMichael's is `michael.brown@brightpath-example.com`.\n\n**09:54 \u2014 Ahmed Hassan:**\n\nWe'll do that.\n\nThanks everyone.\n\n**09:54 \u2014 Meeting ended.**\n", "entities": [{"start": 10, "end": 24, "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sarah Mitchell", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 74, "end": 81, "type": "PERSON", "text": "Michael", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 97, "end": 134, "type": "EMAIL", "text": "sarah.mitchell@brightpath-example.com", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 138, "end": 145, "type": "PERSON", "text": "Michael", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 152, "end": 188, "type": "EMAIL", "text": "michael.brown@brightpath-example.com", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}, {"start": 202, "end": 214, "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ahmed Hassan", "provenance": "independent", "certainty": "certain", "proposed_by": [], "note": ""}], "labeler": "AI assistant; not human-verified", "labeled_at": "2026-09-27", "guideline_version": "1.0", "split": "dev"}
